Centralized Logging: Integrate a lightweight log collector (like Grafana Loki or Promtail) into the compose file to aggregate container stdout/stderr logs directly into your Grafana instance.

Switch to Named Volumes: Drop bind mounts for your application assets (./services/...). Bundle static files inside the container images via Dockerfiles or use dedicated volumes to align with production workflows.

